{"quest_id": 4321, "name": "怨念の宿る鎧", "description": "街が魔物に襲われているとの\n報告を受け現地に赴いた王子たち。\n周囲を取り囲む魔物たちを一掃せよ！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "大地を震わす必殺剣", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920045, "map_no": 3583, "level": 90, "multiplier": 0.9, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2520, "attack": 360, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097264, "master_id": 7}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 25, "form_count": 1, "hp": 576, "attack": 126, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 8}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 135, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 51}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "ふむ……。人間などちっぽけで愚かな存在だと\n思っていたが、こうして恐怖におののく様は\n実に面白い……。", "face": "l86dac703d732"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "逃げ道を塞がれて絶望する姿は滑稽だな。", "face": "l86dac703d732"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、こちらです！\n住民の救出を急ぎましょう！", "face": "l4f5c372ca8da"}, {"name": "カリオペ", "text": "どうやら敵に鎧の魔物もいるみたいね。\n鎧の魔物には魔法が有効よ、王子。", "face": "u42"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "俺たち山賊のパワーがあれば、硬ぇ鎧だろうが\n断ち切ってやるよ。", "face": "u14"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "よかった……。\nどうやら魔物はもういないようです。\nもう少し遅かったらどうなっていたか……。", "face": "l4f5c372ca8da"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "しかし今回の襲撃……。魔物は直接住民を\n狙っているように見えました。王国の警戒態勢を\n強めた方がよろしいかもしれません。", "face": "l4f5c372ca8da"}]}], "active": true}